# PEP 561 marker file - indicates this package supports type checking.
#
# This file is intentionally empty (or nearly empty). Its presence tells
# type checkers like mypy that this package exports type information.
#
# Without this file, mypy treats ALL imports from this package as `Any`,
# which causes errors like:
#   "Class cannot subclass 'BaseNode' (has type 'Any')"
#
# See: https://peps.python.org/pep-0561/
